        a                       ecrm:E12_Production ;
        rdfs:comment            "Although the technique is Ottoman, the drawing is more reminiscent of European botanical drawings of the mid-18th century.  This kerchief may have been embroidered in Istanbul, or in one of the former European provinces of the Otoman empire in which Ottoman embroidery and needlewomen were still highly prized." ;
